[02:10.31]I don't really care because I'm not so dignified (Not so dignified)
[02:16.72]I wish I could be a little moon inside your orbit
[02:22.64]Nothing could be worse than losing you when you're my life
[02:28.25]Do as you wish
[02:32.05]Forget me if you really care (Do as you wish)
[02:38.05]I want you to love me to bits (Do as you wish)
[02:44.28]Forget about the other guys
[02:47.39]You've had inside your heart, inside your mind
[02:53.39]Do as you wish
[02:56.80]Forget me if you really care (Do as you wish)
